 ’re invited to join us early to shop & take photos in the photo booth. B
 everages – wine\, beer\, cider & soft drinks – are available to purcha
 se at the bar. Outside food is welcome\, but outside beverages are not per
 mitted. Mention CTVisit for a free drink at The Woodshed Bar during the pa
 rty.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/words-wood-party-1
